OL,3,GNEWSAMan injured in hammer attack by
OL,4,Amasked burglars
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been taken to hospital after
OL,7,Fbeing assaulted by a group of masked
OL,8,Fmen armed with hammers during an
OL,9,Faggravated burglary in County Antrim.
OL,11,FPolice said the men smashed the front
OL,12,Fdoor and window of a house in the
OL,13,FPrinces Drive area of Newtownabbey on
OL,14,FFriday evening.
OL,16,FThe man, aged in his 30s, suffered
OL,17,Finjuries to his leg, head and back.
OL,19,FTwo women who were also inside the
OL,20,Fhouse were not injured but were left
OL,21,Fbadly shaken.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
